{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15091","headline":"花发上林 · 独孤授","name":"花发上林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑韶容早，芳菲正吐花。\n无言向春日，闲笑任年华。\n润色笼轻霭，睛光艳晚霞。\n影连千户竹，香散万人家。\n幸遶楼台近，仍怀雨露赊。\n愿君垂采摘，不使落风沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤授","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}